[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740010925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114887#issuecomment-3740010925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114887","id":3740010925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e7Amt","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T18:51:45Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T18:51:45Z","body":"I'm not sure such notes are a good idea. They seem like a random fact about `Expression`, of which we could theoretically add a lot.\r\n\r\nIn my opinion, we should create a page like the \"Expression Reference\" (similar to \"GDScript Reference\", \"Shader Language Reference\", and \"BBCode in RichTextLabel\") in the online documentation that lists all the constructs, operators, and their precedence that exist in `Expression`.\r\n\r\nThen we can just add a link to the tutorial and a note to the built-in documentation stating that `Expression`'s syntax doesn't fully match GDScript's syntax.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740010925/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740216266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114887#issuecomment-3740216266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114887","id":3740216266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e7yvK","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T19:45:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T19:45:18Z","body":"Thank you — that’s a very thoughtful perspective. The idea of a dedicated “Expression Reference” page makes sense and fits well with how GDScript and shader documentation are structured.\r\n\r\nMy goal with this PR was mainly to resolve the immediate confusion reported in #114696 by making the limitation visible to users. I’m very open to adjusting the scope of this change if you feel the built-in documentation should stay lighter and simply point to a proper reference page instead.\r\n\r\nPlease let me know how you would prefer me to proceed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740216266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740416991","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114887#issuecomment-3740416991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114887","id":3740416991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7e8jvf","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T20:44:53Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T20:44:53Z","body":"I understand your concern and agree that we should add some kind of note to the current documentation in the meantime. I'm just saying that the current wording is too specific in my opinion.\r\n\r\nIt's likely that this isn't the only difference between `Expression` and GDScript syntax, so it would be insufficient and potentially misleading to mention only this difference and omit the others.\r\n\r\nI think the current compromise would be to reword this note to make it more clear that `Expression` and GDScript are independent systems with different feature sets overall. And, as a temporary solution, we could mention that, for example, `StringName` and `NodePath` literals are not supported (but there are other differences as well).\r\n\r\nIn the future, we should create a more comprehensive \"Expression Reference\" page and update the documentation to say something like \"for a full list of supported constructs and operators, see the online documentation\".","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3740416991/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750771620","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114887#issuecomment-3750771620","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114887","id":3750771620,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fkDuk","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-14T17:36:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-14T17:36:56Z","body":"That makes sense — thank you for clarifying.\r\nI’ll reword the note to make it clear that Expression and GDScript are independent systems with different overall feature sets, include a couple of concrete examples (such as StringName and NodePath literals), and indicate that other differences exist as well. I’ll update the documentation accordingly.\r\n\r\nIf there’s anything else you’d recommend keeping in mind while updating the wording, please let me know.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3750771620/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3754712454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114887#issuecomment-3754712454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114887","id":3754712454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fzF2G","user":{"login":"Arjun-singh-rawatt","id":225551708,"node_id":"U_kgDODXGlXA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225551708?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt","html_url":"https://github.com/Arjun-singh-rawatt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arjun-singh-rawatt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T13:08:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T13:08:06Z","body":"I’m currently running into the “Check for class reference updates” failure in CI after modifying doc/classes/Expression.xml.\r\n\r\nI attempted to regenerate the documentation locally on Windows, and based on the tooling I found (make_rst.py, make_doc.py), it seems the expected next step is to regenerate the class reference files, but I’m running into tooling issues in that process.\r\n\r\nFor context, the note has already been reworded as discussed to reflect that Expression and GDScript are independent systems with broader differences and concrete examples.\r\n\r\nCould you please advise the correct way to regenerate or validate the class reference for this change on Windows?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3754712454/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]